<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Roome</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Roome asuntsis Xaafide Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rome</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rome</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Roome Asuntsis</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafide Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaare Phawuloosa kiita Roome asuntsis xaafidanna, Phawuloosa Roome yeze woosa keetstsi be7ades qoppide gisho E hyanggize wode un giigii naagode fana oochchodes. Phawuloosa qoftta Roome yeze ammanzuntsara eeratsi wode oochchideppa suuba un eza maaddin Isppeene hyanggodes. Ammano baz E eridannon ammanze asuntsana yinna timirttito oochalla feeshode fana qonccizi xaafida. Hyanna maxaafite Phawuloosa kumutsi kiita hyanna qoftto aykkida.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Roome yeze ammanze asuntsana tiino saritsi maaqqii, kaallii unttis woosizanno ohideppa suuba fa kiittis gidda qofa, «Wonggeltte Xoozze xillotitsita qonccida; yinna xillotitsita tiinoppa wurssutsi yellodes ammanora qonccida» ga7i ohine (1:17).</para>
  <para style="ip">Yinnippa suuba, yinna qoftto dalggizii xaafane. Ayhuduntsana maaqqin Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsana maaqqin ubbuntsi nagaras aqiduntsana maaqqide gisho un Xoozara giigodes beezane. Asi Xoozara giigodes dandda7izanna Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanora. Un Xoozara medhdhize hyanna kille yelintte aafita, kille de7o maaqqizanno Phawuloosa dalggizii ohine. Ammanze asi Xoozara saro yene; mahi Xoozze ayyaana baggara nagarappan hyayqo wolqqappa kessii ekkida. Zofane 5-8 yellodes Phawuloosa Xoozze higgiton ammanze asuntsi de7ite oochchize Xoozze ayyaana wolqqa qoftta akko yezako ohine. Yinnippa kaallii, Phawuloosa, «Xoozii as na7untsis qoppide qoftti gidda Ayhuduntsanan Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi wayzi i fettilla waaxinttodes dandda7e?» yagaaze oocitis maltse inggodes butunttida.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mahi Ayhuduntsi Yesuusa ekkanxi ixxidanna Xoozze qofa maaqqikaayzanno ohine. Yinna hyanidanna Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara qonccide aadho keehatitsi gidda as kochchi ubba ekkinttode fana. Maaqqo yezin, Ayhuduntsi Yesuusa ekkode wode yo7odanno Phawuloosa ammanane. Wurssutsite Phawuloosa ammano de7o wayzi yessades beezzako ohine. Xoozis oochchode baz, ammanze asuntsi fa kaatisin fa gidda fetay fetays aadatitsara oochchodebazin wozina gaatsa medhinttide oocizebaz qonccizi ohine.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Gele qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-15">1:1-15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Roome kiita omma qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:16-17">1:16-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">As na7as atotitsi koshshizanno <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:18-3:20">1:18—3:20</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoozze as ashshize oge <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-4:25">3:21—4:25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa gidda benttize kille de7o <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 5:1-8:39">5:1—8:39</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isra7eeles Xoozze qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 9:1-11:36">9:1—11:36</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ammanze asunts yessi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12:1—15:13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xaatsi qofan saritse <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 15:14-16:27">15:14—16:27</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa aro maaqqide, hawaare maaqqade gaara xeeginttideppan Xoozze Wonggele sabbakode gaara doorinttide Phawuloosa kiittide kiita.<verse eid="ROM 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Xoozii gaama wodeppa tiino fa nabunts baggara inggoda yagayde Xoozze geeshi Maxaafite xaafinttida. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Hyay Wonggelize ashora Dawute kochchappa yelinttide, Xoozze na7a, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosas. <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>Mahi E fa geeshi ayyaanara hyayqoppa denddii, Xoozze na7a maaqqidanno damma wolqqara beezida. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>E baggara Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi ubba, ammanii kiitinttode gaar Kiristtoosa suntsiti gisho Xoozze aadho keehatitsin hawaaretitsi adetits wolqqa nu ekkida. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Yesuusa Kiristtoosas maaqqade fana xeeginttide asuntsappa bagguntsi yinttana.<verse eid="ROM 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Roome yeze, Xoozii yiqsinttizuntsana ees geeshi worzha maaqqade fana dooriduntsis.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Xoozze nu Adeppan Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosappa aadho keehatitsin sarotitsi yinttis maaqqe.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galatan woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Ubbappa tiinii, yin ammantta sa7a ubba sinttide gisho Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara yin gisho ta Xoozza galatane. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Taanii E na7ay wonggelebaz kumutsi wozintte ohize Xoozze, taanii ta woostte ubba wode yinttana qoppizannis E markka. <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>Wurssutsite, Xoozze qofa maaqqiko, taanii yinttago hyanggodes oge taas giigode fana ubba wode woossane. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Taanii yinttis ayyaana anjjo shaakkodesin yinttana be7ades amudhdhane. <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>Yinnan, taanii yin ammantten, mahi yin ta ammantte minggode fanas.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Ta ishuntso, taanii Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsappa aafe denggidanni fana, yinttappan aafe denggodes yinttago hyanggodes qoppida, yezin kayinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:21">Hawa. 19:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Girike asuntsisin Girike maaqqoosse asuntsis mahi cincunsisin boozuntsis taas gale yene.<verse eid="ROM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Yinnii gisho, Roome yeze yinttisin Wonggele ohodes amudhdhane.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wonggele Xoozze wolqqa</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Tiinidhii Ayhuduntsana, mahi Ayhude maaqqoosuntsanan ammanza ubba ashshodes Wonggele Xoozze wolqqa maaqqide gisho ta Wonggelera yeellidhoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:38">Mar. 8:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Xillo ammanora de7o yessada ga7intti Geeshi Maxaafite xaafinttida. Wonggele Xoozze xillotitsito qonccizida; tiinoppa wurssutsi yellodes asi xillidhize ammanora.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:4">Ibr. 2:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asunts iitatitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Turita ernttaame fana fa iita oochara kammize asuntsalla afa nagara ubballa afa, Xoozze hyanqqo saloppa wodhdhoda. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Xoozii unttis qonccissades beezzebaz qonccizide gisho un Xoozze baz erane. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Alame medhinttideppa dentsii, asis benttoosse Xoozze hyano, yinnan E medhina wolqqan Xoozzetitsi E medhetitsite qonccii yeze gisho asuntsi fa iitatitsitis mikinaate maaqqize baz baaya.<verse eid="ROM 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Un Xoozza erittera, eza bonchchikaayan galatikaaya. Un qofita maaddoosse baz maaqqida; un qoppoosse wozintta dhumida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:17-18">Efe. 4:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Un fana cinccuntsana gaane, yezin boozuntsana. <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>Un hyayqqoosse Xoozza goynodanno ashshii, hyayqqize as medhon, landdan, xootsin sazara gochunttize baz aazizi medhdhide misile goynane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:16-18">Mahe 4:16-18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Yinnii gisho, un fetay fetayra iita baz oochchii, fa gallito kawushode gaar Xoozii un wozintto amudhdhize tuna oochas unttana olida. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Yinna hyanidanna un Xoozze turtto worddo laammide gishon medhdhide Xoozza ashshii, medhinttide baz goynide gisho. Xoozii medhinas galatinttida. Amin77e.<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozii unttana tuna amotitsis aatsii inggida. Un maachuntsi faas beezize dhiiratsara yellinttizanno ashshii, beezoosse baz hyanii maacha maachira yellinttane. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Yinnii gaar, dhiiratsi faas beezize maachira yellinttizanno ashshii, dhiiratsi dhiiratsara yellinttane. Dhiiratsuntsii fetay fetayra amotitsara eexinttii, yeellize baz oochchida. Fa oochchide bala oochitis beezize firdda ekkida.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Un Xoozza erittera, melle atto yezin E baz qoppodes koyanxi ixxide gisho beezoosse baz oochchode gaar Xoozii unttana maaddoose qofas aatsii inggida. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Un qohera, iitatitsara, zhimbbarara, genera, qinaatera, shemppo wodhera, lallera, cimoran iita amora kumida. Un zigirizuntsana, <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>As suntsi iissizuntsana, Xooz ixxizuntsana, cazhizuntsana, utirzuntsana, ceeqizuntsana, iita baz oochchodes koyzuntsana fa adaysin inttisin kiitinttoosuntsana, <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>tiiroossuntsana, qaala laamizuntsana, siiqo baayzuntsana, yiqsimo baayzuntsana. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Hyantses fana oochchizuntsis hyayqo beezane gaaze Xoozze higge erittera, hyanno oochchane. Un fa faas oochchizanno xalaala maaqqikaayzin oochchize melluntsanan likke ga7i nashshane.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze xillo firdda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Yinnii gisho, naate melluntsalla afa firddizayo, ne mikinaate mahize baaya. Ne melluntsalla afa firdditera, ye ne firddize atstse gaar oochchiko, ne, neella afa firddane. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Yinnii fana oocha oochchizuntsalla afa Xoozze xillo firdda firddizanno nu erane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:1">Maato. 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:37">Luqa. 6:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Naate, yinnii gaar oocha oochchizuntsalla afa firddizayo, un oochchizanni gaar oochchizayo, ne Xooz firddappa attode gaar aazane? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Woy Xoozze keehatitsi, genccon dandda7a duretitsito leqqane? Xoozze nees dalgga maaqqidanna nena nagarappa mahodes maaqqidanno erosaane?<verse eid="ROM 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Yezin yinttis shuchchi wozinan si7oosse hyaye yene. Yinnii gisho, Xoozze hyanqon xillo firdda qonccize qamma, neella afa firdda shiishane. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Xoozze fetays fetays E oochiti gaar inggoda. <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Lo77o oochara miinggi, galata, bonchchon dhaboosse de7o koyzuntsis Xoozze medhina de7o inggoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 62:12">Maz. 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 24:12">Aazi. 24:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Yezin fana siiqizuntsana, turtto ixxizuntsana iita baz oochchodes koyzuntsalla afa Xoozze kachchin bosha yo7oda. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Iita baz oochchize asuntsi ubba, tiinii Ayhuduntsana, kaallii Girikuntsana madhan waayen yelloda. <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Yezin Xoozze lo77o oocha oochchize ubbuntsis, tiinii Ayhuduntsi, kaallii Girikuntsis galata, bonchchon sarotitsi ingginttoda. <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Xoozii sino bi7i asi shaakkoos.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Higge baayzin nagara oochchide ubbuntsi higge baytsi dhaboda. Higge yezin, nagara oochchide ubbuntsi higgera firddinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Mahe 10:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Xoozze tiintte xillizuntsi higge naagizuntsap attin higge si7e xalaala si7izuntsana baaya. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Higge baayze Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi medho higge kiittizanno oochchane. Unttis xaafinttide higge baayzinin un fa wozintte higge erane. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Un hyanotitsita, higge kiita un wozintte xaafinttidanno beezane. Mahi un wozintta unttalla afa markkidhane. Un wozintta fettii fettii tohe unttana balida gaane; fettii fettii tohe unttana turo gaane. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Ta tamaarsside Wonggele fana Xoozze Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara as wozintte aachinttide qoftta firddize wode erinttoda.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayhuduntsanan un higgito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Yezin ne nena Ayhude gaane; higgella katane; Xoozalla ceeqane. <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>Ne oochchode gaar Xoozii koyze baz akko yezako erane. Higge tamaaride gisho turo maaqqize baz shaakkii erane. <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>Ne qooquntsana kaallizanno, mahi dhuma yezuntsis foo7o maaqqizanno shaakkii erane. <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>Ne higgefa denggide eratitsin turetitsara boozuntsana erisizayan zhooguntsana tamaarssizaya maaqqidanno erane. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Yeezin, ne melluntsana tamaarssizay ne nena akkos tamaarssoso? Ne, «Kaysitippe» ga7itera, ne ne ommite kaystanen? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Ne, «Olale hyanttippete» ga7itera, ne ne ommite olale hyanttane? Ne eeqa ixxitera, eeqa yeze keetsito bonqane? <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Ne Xoozze wogite ceeqinttane, yezin higgitis kiitinttanxi ixxii Xoozza yeellizane? <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Geeshi Maxaafite, «Yin mikinaate Xoozze suntsita Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsara cazhinttane» ga7intti xaafinttida.<verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Ne higges kiitinttiko, ne garrazinttis maade yene, yezin ne higgitis kiitinttanxi ixxko ne garrazinttidanna garrazinttikaayze fana maaqqane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Isa. 59:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi garrazinttikaayzara, higgitis kiitnttiko, Xoozii eza garrazinttide fana faydosoone? <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Yin, Ayhude asuntsi, yinttis xaafinttide higgiton garrazinttii yeezittera, yin higges kiitinttanxi ixxiko, Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi garrazinttanxi ixxikon higges kiitinttii, yinttalla afa firddoda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Yinttalla afa firddoda: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Un hyanotitsita woy un lo77o oochita yinttalla afa firddoda.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Yikke, suntsara Ayhude maaqqide ubbuntsi turii Ayhude baaya. Mahi bale galla garrazizanna turii garraze baaya. <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Yezin turii Ayhudetitsi gaatstsa Ayhude maaqqizanno. Turii garrazintte Xoozze Ayyaanara oocinttize wozina garrazinttep attin xaafinttide wogite oochinttize galla garraze baaya. Ye atstse galata Xoozappa ekkanep attin asappa baaya.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayhuduntsi ammananxii ixxe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Yeezin, Ayhude maaqqizanna akko maadde? Woy garrazinttes akko maaddize bazi yeze? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Ubbappa tiino Xoozii fa qaala hyadarito Ayhuduntsis inggida.<verse eid="ROM 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Yeezin, unttappa fetay fetaya qaala ammananxii ixxiko, un ixxizanna Xoozii ammaninttide Xooz maaqqizanno kayanene? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Kayoos! Asi ubba worddo maaqqikon Xoozii turo maaqqe. Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">«Ne qaaltte ne xillane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">nena mootizaya firddara latstsane»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 3:4">ga7intti xaafinttida.<verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Yeezin, nu nagartta Xoozze xillo maaqqizanno beezize baz maaqqikon, nu waagawude? Xoozii nu nagartti gisho nuulla afa firddiko, likke baane? Yinno taanii as qofa fana gaane. <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Yinnii fana hyanippe. Yinnii gaar hyaniko, Xoozii hyanna alamttilla afa wayzi firddode?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Yezin ta worddotitsita Xoozze turtto qonccizi, E bonchchito gaantsi beezzebaz maaqqiko, yeezin, akkos taalla fana nagaranchcho fana firdde? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Fettii fettii asuntsi, «Lo77o yo7ode fana iita oochchoda?» yaga7i tamaarssize asi fana mahi tana mootane. Yinnii gisho yagaaze asalla afa ye7ize Xoozze firddita likke.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asi ubba nagaranchcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Yeezin, nu waagawude? Nu Ayhuduntsi, Girikeppa aadhanene? Ade! Ayhude maaqqin, Ayhude maaqqanxin ubbuntsi nagaranchcho maaqqizanno taanii tiinii yinttis ohida.<verse eid="ROM 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">«Xillo asi fetton baaya.<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>Akaakize asi baaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">Xoozza koyze oonin baaya.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Asi ubba balinttida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">ubbuntsi fettippa maaddoosse baz maaqqida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">Lo77o oochchize oonin baaya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">fettii asin baaya.<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>Un doontta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">bugunttide booza fana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">fa il7antsite worddidhdhane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">Un doonttippa as wodhize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">shooshi marze kezane.<verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>Un doontte camon baaditsi kumida.<verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>Un tohita suutsi lalodes ellisane.<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>Un ogite dhaben qohe yene.<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>Un saro oge eroos.<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>Fa de7ite Xoozis zhashtoos»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 3:18">ga7intti xaafinttida.<verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>As ubba doona gordinttode fana kumutsi alamito Xoozze firddappa oomora shiishodes, higge ingginttide higgeppa oomora yezuntsis maaqqidanno nu erane. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Yinnii gisho, ooden higges kiitinttii Xoozze tiino xillodes dandda7oos. Higge asi ubba nagaranchcho maaqqizanno beezane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Maz. 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gala. 2:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xillotitsi ammanora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Yezin hyatte Xoozii asi xillize oge higge baytsi qonccizida. Yinna ogito Muse higgen nabuntsin markkidhida. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Yinna ammanze ubbas hyanida, Xoozii Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara as ubbas shaako baytsi inggida.<verse eid="ROM 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Asi ubba nagara oochchida; Xoozze bonchcho faccizida. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Yezin un Xoozze aadho keehatitsara, ashshize Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggara cer xillida. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Xoozii Yesuus Kiristtoosa zharsho mahi inggida, eza ammanze ubba E suutsite nagara atotitsi denggode fana. Xoozii yinno oochchide fa dandda7ara zaga nagartto faydikaayzara ashshii, fa xillotitsito beessades. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>Yesuusa ammanze ubba xillode fana hyatte wode Xoozze fa ommite xillo maaqqizanno beessades.<verse eid="ROM 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Yeezin, nu ceeqinttize baz akko yeze? Akkon baaya. Nuunii ceeqinttizanna higges kiitinttize gishone? Ade! Ammano higgera. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Xoozii asi xillize ammanorap attin higges kiitinttera baayzanno nu qoppane.<verse eid="ROM 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Woy Xoozii Ayhuduntsi xalaala Xoozoone? Ayhude maaqqoosuntsisin Xoozii baane? Turo, Ayhude maaqqoosuntsisin E Xoozii. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Xoozii fetto; Ayhuduntsanan Ayhude maaqqoosuntsana ammanora xillize eza. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Yeezin, nuunii higge ammano gisho dhabssodane? Ade! Higgito mintsanep attin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Mahe 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:20">Gala. 3:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Abrahama ammanora xillida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Yeezin, nu aday Abrahama akko denggido? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>Abrahama oochara xillidebaz maaqqiko, E ceeqinttize baz yene, Yezin, Xoozze tiino ceeqinttodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Geeshi maxaafite, «Abrahama Xooz ammanida; Xoozii yinno ees xillotitsi mahi faydida» gayda.<verse eid="ROM 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Oochchize atstses ekkize damoozita, E oocha wolqqitis ciginttize galep attin ees imo baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Medho 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:6">Gala. 3:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Yezin oocha oochchoosse oonin nagaranchcho xillize Xoozza ammaniko, E ammantta ees xillotitsi maaqqii faydinttane. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Geeshi Maxaafite Dawute, oocha baytsi Xoozii xillize asuntsi akko gaar anjjintezako hyannii gaar yaga7i qonccizida:<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>«Un balita atto ga7inttiduntsi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">un nagartta kaminttiduntsi anjjinttida.<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Laatstsii E nagartto faydoosse atstse anjjinttida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Maz. 32:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Yeezin, Dawute ohide anjjita garrazinttide asuntsis xalaalasone? Woy garrazinttikaayze asuntsiso? Nuunii, «Geeshi Maxaafta, ‹Abrahama Xooz ammanida; Xoozii yinno ees xillotitsi mahi faydida› gaane» nu yagayda. <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Yeezin, yinna ayde hyanido? Abrahama garrazinttinine? Woy garrazinttikaayzin? Garrazintteppa tiino hyanidap attin suuba baaya.<verse eid="ROM 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Abrahama garrazinttodannippa tiino E ammantta ees xillotetsi maaqqii faydinttidanno ersodes, E garrazintta malla maaqqida. Yinnii gisho, Abrahama garrazinttikaayzara ammanzuntsisin ammanora xillizuntsis ubba ade maaqqida. <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>E garrazinttezuntsisin ade. Abrahama unttis aday maaqqide un garrazinttide gisho xalaala baayzin E garrazinttodannippa tiino ammanide ammantto un kaallide gishos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Medho 17:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze ufayssita ammanora ekkinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Abrahamasin E zerttis, «Alamito ta yinttis inggoda» yagayde ufayssita, Abrahama ammanora xillide gishos fattin higge naagii folide gisho baaya. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Higges kiitinttiduntsi Xoozze ufayssito laatizuntsana maaqqiko, ammano maaddoos; Xoozze ufayssitan cer maaqqane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:4-6">Medho 17:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17-18">22:17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:29">Gala. 3:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Higge Xoozze kachchi ke7ine, yezin higge baayze bessa higge aadhen ashshen baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:18">Gala. 3:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozii inggide ufayssita ammanora ekkinttane. Hyanna ufayssita Abrahama kochchi ubbas Xoozze aadho keehatitsi baggara ingginttidanno qonccizane. Yinnan higge naagizuntsis xalaalas baayzin Abrahama fana ammanide ubbuntsis. Abrahama nu ubbuntsis ade. <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>Geeshi Maxaafite, «Ta nena gaama worzhas ade mahida» ga7intti Abrahama gisho xaafinttida. Yinna ufayssita Abrahamas ingginttide hyayqqiduntsis de7o inggizen baayze baz yezize Xoozze eza maaqqidanno E ammanide gishos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:7">Gala. 3:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Xoozii Abrahamas ne kochchita ganggoda gaydanna, ufayssi gaddodes akkon dandda7inttoose wode Abrahama Xooz ammanide gishon ufayssi gaddide gisho gaama worzhas ade maaqqida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Medho 17:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Abrahamas xeet bere kumida maaqqikon, fa cinggide ashiten Saara na7a yelodes dandda7oosanno erittera fa ammantte labbikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Medho 15:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>E fa ammantte miinggi Xoozis bonchcho inggidap attin Xoozii inggide ufayssito ammananxii, so7ikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:17">Medho 17:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Abrahama, Xoozii inggide ufaysito folodanno fa kumutsi wozintte ammanida. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozii E ammantto xillotitsi mahi faydida.<verse eid="ROM 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>Yezin, «Faydinttida» gaaze qaalize Abrahamas xalaala xaafinttikaaya. <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>Ye qaalize nu Laatstse Yesuusa hyayqoppa dentside Xoozza ammanze nuusin nu ammantta xillotitsi maaqqii faydinttode gaar xaafinttida. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Xoozii eza nu nagartti gisho hyayqos aatsii inggida; E nuna xillissades hyayqoppa denddida.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s1">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:0 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:4-5">Isa. 53:4-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Xoozara yeze sarotitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Yikke, nu ammanora xillide gisho nu laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara Xoozara nuus sarotitsi yene. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Nu E baggara hyatte nu eqqide aadho keehatitsite ammanora gelida. Yinnii gisho, nu Xoozze bonchcho ufayssite ceeqinttane.<verse eid="ROM 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Yinno xalaala baayzin madha dandda7a ki7izanno nu erize gisho nu madhiten ceeqinttane. <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>Mahi dandda7a faatana, fatanan ufayssi inggizanno nu erane. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>Nuus inggide Geeshi Ayyaana baggara Xoozii fa siiqito nu wozintte gusside gisho yinna ufayssita nuna yeellizoos.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Nu hyaga labbiduntsana maaqqii yezin, Xoozze wode yellin, Kiristtoosa nagaranchchuntsi gisho hyayqqida. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Xillo as gisho hyayqqode asi denggodanna damma madha, yezin lo77o as gisho hyayqqode asi oode erize benttikaayzara attoos. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Yezin nuunii hyaga nagaranchcho maaqqii yezin, Kiristtoosa nu gisho hyayqqida. Yinna Xoozii nuna akko gaar siiqizako E siiqito beezane. <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Yikke, nuunii Kiristtoosa suutsite xilldebaz maaqqiko, ubbappa aatsii E baggara Xoozze hyanqoppa attoda. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Nuunii Xoozara morkke, yezin E na7ay hyayqite eera giigida. Yinnippa aatsii, hyatte nuunii Xoozara giigideppa suuba E na7ay de7o mikinaatera nuunii attoda. <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Yinno xalaala baayzin hyatte nuna Xoozara giigizide nu laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara nu Xoozalla ceeqinttane.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Addaaman Kiristtoosan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Addaama baggara nagara hyanna alamite gelida. Yinna nagartti baggara hyayqo yi7ida. Asi ubba nagara oochchide gisho hyayqo as kochchi ubba yellida. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Higge ingginttodannippa tiino alame nagara yene, yezin higge baayze wode nagara nagara maaqqii faydinttoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:6">Medho 3:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Yezin Addaamappa Muse yellodes hyayqo as ubba ahida. Melle atto yezin, Addaama higges kiitinttanxide gisho, Addaama fana nagara oochchikaayzuntsalla afa hyayqo ka7itida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Addaama yo7odes yeze Yesuusas aazize. <verse eid="ROM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Yezin Xoozze aadho keehatitsi as nagartti fana baaya. Fettii as nagara baggara gaama asuntsi hyayqqida. Yezin Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara Xoozze aadho keehatitsi as ubbas gaantsi ingginttida. <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Addaama nagara giddan Xoozze imo gidda gaama dummatitsi yene. Fettii as nagara baggara Xoozii eella afa firddida. Yezin asi gaama nagara oochchinin Xoozze aadho keehatitsita xillotitsi ki7ida. <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Fettii as nagara baggara hyayqo ka7itida. Yezin Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara Xoozze aadho keehatitsin xillotitsi imo ekkize ubbuntsi, game de7or yessada.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Yikke, fettii asi nagara oochchide baggara as ubballa firdda yi7idanni fana fettii asi xillo oochchide baggara, Xoozii as ubba xillizii unttis de7o inggane. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Fettii asi kiitinttanxi ixxide baggara, gaama asuntsi nagaranchcho maaqqidanni fana fettii as kiitintter gaama asi xilloda.<verse eid="ROM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Asuntsi nagara wolqqa erode fana higge yi7ida, yezin nagara wolqqa gaanggide wode Xoozze aadho keehatitsi aadhii ganggida. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Nagara hyayqo wolqqara ka7itidanni fana Xoozze aadho keehatitsi xillotits wolqqara ka7iti, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara nuna medhina de7ogo kaalitsane.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Nagaras hyayqqii Kiristtoosara yeze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Yeezin, nu waagawude? Xoozze aadho keehatitsita gaanggode fana nagarara miinggi yessane? <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Atto hyanoos, nuunii nagaras hyayqidebaz maaqqiko, yeezin, nuunii yikkeppa wayzi nagarara yessade? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Nu ubbuntsi Kiristtoosa Yesuusara fetto maaqqades xammaqinttide wode E hyayqite eera wolla mooginttida. <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Nu xammaqinttide wode Kiristtoosara hyayqqidanne moogunttida. Kiristtoosa Xoozze Aday bonchcho wolqqara hyayqqoppa denddidanni fana nuunin kille de7o yessada.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Nu E hyayqite eera fetto maaqqiko, yinnii gaaran, E denddite eera fetto maaqqada.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:12">Qola. 2:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Nu yikkeppa nagaras aro maaqqaame fanan nu nagaranchcho asatitsito wolqqita dhabode fana nu gal77a asatitsito Kiristtoosara suxxidanno erane. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Fettii asi hyayqidebaz maaqqiko, E nagara wolqqappa wallo kezane. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Nuunii Kiristtoosara hyayqiko, eera de7o yessadanno ammanane. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Kiristtoosa hyayqoppa denddide gisho mahi E hyayqosannon hyayqo tiinosin eza ahosanno nu erane. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>E hyayqqide wode nagaras fettii tohe wurssutsi yellodes hyayqida, yezin hyatte de7o Xoozis yene. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Yinnii fanan, yin nagaras hyayqqii, Laatstse Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggara Xoozis de7o yezanno qoppote.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Yinnii gisho, yin, yin asatetsito amos kiitinttaame fana hyayqqize yin asatetsito nagara ahippe. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Mahi yin asatits kifiltto nagara oochchodes gene ola miishe mahi inggippete. Yezin yin hyayqoppa denddii, de7o yeze asi fana yin asatetsito Xoozis inggote. Mahi yin kumutsi asatetsito xillo ola miishe mahi Xoozis aatsii inggote. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Yin Xoozze aadho keehatitsis oomora yenep attin higgeppa oomora yezoosse gisho nagara yinttana ahodes beezoos.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xillotits aro maaqqe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Yeezin, nu waagawude? Higgeppa oomora maaqqikaayzin Xoozze aadho keehatitsappa oomora yeze gisho nagara oochchodaane? Mulon hyanoos! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Yin fettii asis kiitinttodes yinttana aro mahi inggiko yinna yin kiitinttizes aro maaqqizanno erote. Yinnii gaara, yin nagaras kiitinttiko, yinttis hyayqo ki7ize nagaras aro maaqqane. Woy yin Xoozis kiitinttiko xillotitsi ki7ize Xoozis aro maaqqane. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Zaga yin nagaras aro, yezin hyatte yin ekkide turii timirttes kumutsi wozinappa kiitinttide gisho Xoozis galata maaqqe. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Yin nagara arotitsi achchappa bilnttii xillotits aro maaqqida.<verse eid="ROM 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Yin yin qofite labbezuntsana maaqqide gisho taanii oodesin gelize ogera ohine. Zaga yin, yin asatetsito tunan iita baz oochchodes aro mahi inggidanni fana hyatte yin asatets kifiltto geeshi maaqqade fana xillotetsi aro mahi inggote.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Yin nagaras aro yeze wode xillotitsis aqoos. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Yinttana hyatte yeellize zaga yin iita oochitippa akko maade denggidote? Yinna oochitis wurssutsita hyayqo. <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Yezin yin nagara arotitsappa bilinttii, Xoozze aro maaqqida. Yinna yinttana geeshi mahi medhina de7o kaalitsane. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Nagara damooze hyayqo. Yezin Xoozze, nu Laatstse Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggara inggize imotitsita medhina de7o.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Ekken gelen aazize</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Ta ishuntso, taanii higge erize asuntsis ohine. Higge fettii asi faxa yeze wode eza ahizanno eroso? <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Aazizes, azinii gelide maachita I azinze faxa yeze wode higgera ezara acinttida. Yezin I azinze hyayqiko ezara iza caaqide caaqita izo ahoos. <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>Yinnii gisho, iza fa azinze faxa yezin, melle dhiiratsi geliko, iza laammida ga7inttane. Yezin I azinze hyayqiko, caaqo izo ahoosse gisho iza melle azinii geliko, iza olalida ga7inttoos.<verse eid="ROM 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Yinnii gisho, ta ishuntso, yin Kiristtoosa asho baggara higge wolqqas hyayqqii, Xoozis aafe aafodes hyayqoppa denddide Kiristtoosas maaqqida. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Nu asho amo nuna ahin, nu yeze wode higge gujjii nagara oochchode gaar nuna dentsitsane. Nu ashtii gidda iita amotitsi yeze gisho nuunii hyayqo aafe aafode fana oochchane yeshsha. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Yezin hyatte nuunii nuna accide higgitis hyayqide gisho nuunii higge achchappa bilnttida. Yinnii gisho, kille Ayyaanar Xoozis kiitinttanep attin xaafinttide gal77a higgitis kiitinttoos.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Higgen nagaran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Yeezin, nuunii waagawude? Higge nagarane? Ade! Yezin higge nagara akko yezako tana erssida. Higge, «Amudhdhippe» gaykaayzako, amudhdhe akko yezako ta eroos. <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Yezin ta ubba baz amudhdhode fana nagara higge baggara ta gidda oge denggida. Higge baayzako nagara hyayqqide baz.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Keze 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:21">Mahe 5:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Zaga higge baayze wode ta faxa, yezin higge ingginttide wode nagara faxin ta hyayqqida. <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>Taanii de7o yessade fana Xoozii inggide higge taas hyayqo ki7ida. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Nagara higge baggara tana cimmize oge denggi, wodhida.<verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Yinnii gisho, higge geeshi; ize xaafinttide kiittan geeshi, xillon lo77o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:13">Medho 3:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Yeezin, lo77o maaqqide baz taalla afa hyayqo ki7idaane? Ade! Yezin nagara nagara maaqqizanna qonccode fana lo77o bazara maaddinttii taas hyayqo ki7ida. Yinnii gisho, nagara nagara maaqqidanna higge baggara aadhii erinttida.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Nuunii higge ayyaanabaz maaqqizanno erane. Yezin taanii nagaras bayzinttide asho asi. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Taanii ta oochchizanno tiiroos; taanii kadhizebaz oochchodanno ashshii ta ixxizebaz oochchane. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Taanii ixxizebaz oochchizebaz maaqqiko, higge lo77o maaqqizanno ta markkidhane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gala. 5:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Yinno maaqqiko, yinna oochito ta gidda yeze nagartta oochchanep attin ta oochchoos.<verse eid="ROM 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Ta gidda, yinnan ta ashite lo77o baz baazanno erane. Lo77o baz oochchize amotitsi ta gidda yene, yezin lo77o baz oochchodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Taanii ixxize iita baz oochchanep attin ta kadhize lo77o baz oochchoos. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Taanii ixxizebaz oochchizebaz maaqqiko, yinna ta gidda yeze nagartta oochchanep attin oochchize tana baaya.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Yikke, ta lo77o baz oochchodes kadhizin, iita baz oochchizanno beezize higge denggida. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Taanii ta wozintte Xoozze wogite ufayttane. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Yezin ta asatitsite yezay ta guugite yeze higgera olinttize dumma higge be7ine. Ye higgize ta asatitsite oochchize nagara higges tana aro mahi inggida. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Taanii wayzi alla wodhdhide aso? Hyayqos kanggize hyanna asatitsitippa tana ashshode oode? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara tana ashshize Xoozzes galata maaqqe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Yikke, taanii ta qofite Xoozze higges aqane; yezin ta asatitsite nagara higges aqane.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Geeshi Ayyaana de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Yinnii gisho, Kiristtoos Yesuusara yezuntsi hyatte firdda baaya. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Kiristtoos Yesuusa baggara nuus de7o inggize Geeshi Ayyaana higge, tana nagaran hyayqo higge arotitsappa kessida. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Nu nagara asatitsiti baggara, higge leppide gisho nuna ashshodes dandda7ikaaya. Xoozii fa na7aya nagaranchcho asuntsis aazizi nagaras zharsho maaqqode fana kiittii yinno oochchida. Yeyzi, Xoozii Kiristtoosa ashtii baggara, nagara firddi hyaasida. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Xoozii yinno oochchidanna, nu asho amo koyzanni fana baayzin Geeshi Ayyaana koyzanni fana yeze nuulla afa higge xillo kiita folinttode fana.<verse eid="ROM 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Asho qofar yezuntsi ashobaz qoppane. Yezin Geeshi Ayyaana qofar yezuntsi Geeshi Ayyaanabaz qoppane. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Nu qoftta asho amos aqiko hyayqo ke7ine, yezin ayyaanas aqiko de7on sarotits ke7ine. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Asho amos aqize asi Xoozze higges kiitinttodes koyoosse gishon kiitinttodes dandda7oosse gisho Xoozara morkke. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Asho amos aqizuntsi Xooz ufayssodes dandda7oos.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Yezin Xoozze Ayyaana yinttara yeziko yinttalla aqiko, yin Ayyaana qofa yenep attin yin asho amos aqoos. Kiristtoos Ayyaana baayzin oonin Kiristtoosas maaqqoos. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Yezin Kiristtoosa yin gidda yeziko, yin asatitsito nagara baggara hyayqqidanno. Yezin yin ayyaanize xillotitsi baggara de7o yene. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Yezin Yesuusa hyayqoppa dentside Xoozze Ayyaana yin gidda yeziko, Kiristtoosa hyayqoppa dentside Xoozii, yinttara yeze fa Geeshi Ayyaanara hyayqqide yin asatitsitis de7o inggoda.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Yikke, ta ishuntso gale yene, nuunii nu asho amo kaallii yessades beezoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Qoro. 3:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Yin, yin asho amos yeziko hyayqoda, yezin Geeshi Ayyaana wolqqara nagara oochito wodhiko yin de7o yessada. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Xoozze Ayyaana kaallize ubbuntsi Xoozze na7untsana. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Nuunii, «Abbo, ta Adayo» yaga7i xeegize, Xoozze na7untsana mahize Geeshi Ayyaana ekkidap attin mahi zhashimora yessades aro mahize ayyaana ekkikaaya. <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Xoozze Ayyaana nu ayyaanara maaqqii nuunii Xoozze na7a maaqqizanno markkidhane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mar. 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 4:6">Gala. 4:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Nuunii E na7a maaqqiko Xoozza laattoda; Kiristtoosara wolla yinno laattoda. Mahi nuunii Kiristtoosara waaye ekkiko eera wolla E bonchchito shaakkinttoda.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yo7ode bonchcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Nuunii hyatte waayize waayito, tiinoppa nuus qonccode bonchchora yeltsi bi7iko, wolkkissades dandda7inttoos ga7i qoppane. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Medhetitsi ubba Xoozze na7a qonccitsito gaama amudhdhii kafane. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Medhetitsi ubba hyarii maaqqida; yinnan, medhetitsita dooror baayzin ufayssara naagode fana oochchide Xoozze qofa hyanida. <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>Medhetitsi fa ommite dhabe arotitsappa kezii, Xoozze na7untsara wallo bonchcho gishinttoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-19">Medho 3:17-19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Medhetitsi wolla hyayno yellodes yelo dha7e aykkide maachiti fana inxixeran un7ara yezanno nu erane. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Mahi yinno medhetitsiti xalaala baayzin Geeshi Ayyaana imo ekkide nuunii, nu ommite nu asatitsitis wozo maaqqide Xoozze na7a maaqqize ufayssito naagitera nu asatitsite inxixane. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Yinna ufaysite nuunii attida. Yezin nuunii ufayssi oochchizebaz benttize baz maaqqiko yinno oonii ufayssi oochchize?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:2-4">2 Qoro. 5:2-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Yezin nu bi7ikaayze baz denggodes ga7i ufayssara naagiko yinno dandda7ara naagane.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Yinnii gaar Geeshi Ayyaana nu labitsite maaddane. Nuunii Xooz wayzi woosodes beezizako eroos, yezin Geeshi Ayyaana fa ommite, asi ohodes dandda7oosse qaalar nuus shoobbane. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Mahi asi wozina erize Xoozze Geeshi Ayyaana qoftta akko yezako erane. Geeshi Ayyaana Xoozze qoftti gaar geeshshuntsis shoobbane.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Xoozza siiqizuntsisin E qoftti gaar xeeginttezuntsis Xoozii ubba baz lo77oos oochchizanno nu erane. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Xoozza eriduntsi fa na7aya aazode fanan na7ayin ammanizunts gidda anggis maaqqade fana unttana doorii gaddida. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Xoozii tiino dooriduntsana xeegida; xeegiduntsana xillizida; xilliziduntsana mahi bonchchida.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze siiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Yeezin, nu hyanna ubbannis waagawude? Xoozii nu bagga maaqqiko nuna oode ixxode? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>E melle atto yezin, fa na7ays yiqsinttikaayzara, nu gisho aatsii inggida. Yeezin, fa na7aya nuus aatsii inggide wayzi E ubba baz cer inggoso?<verse eid="ROM 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Xoozii dooriduntsana oode mootode? Xillize Xoozii firddize oode? <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Yeezin, unttalla afa firddodes dandda7ize oode? Oonin baaya. Hyayqoppa denddii Xoozze mizaqite bettide, Kiristtoos Yesuusa, E nuus shoobbane.<verse eid="ROM 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Yikke, nuna Kiristtoosa siiqoppa shagode oode? Waayene woy madhane woy bay7ene woy naye woy kallotitsone woy zhashimone woy olane? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">«Nuunii ne gisho awara kumutsi hyayqqane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">shufos kanggize duro fana faydinttida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 8:36">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 44:2">Maz. 44:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>ga7intti xaafinttide fana maaqqida.<verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Yezin nuunii hyanne ubba, nuna siiqize Kiristtoosara gamizuntsappa aadhane.<verse eid="ROM 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Yinnii gisho, hyayqo maaqqin de7o maaqqin kiitanchchuntsana maaqqin ahizuntsana maaqqin hyatte yezaya maaqqin tiinoppa yo7odaya maaqqin wolqqamuntsana maaqqin, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>dhoqqa maaqqin ziqqa maaqqin akko medhetitsi maaqqin nu Laatstse, Kiristtoos Yesuusara yeze Xoozze siiqoppa nuna shaakkodes dandda7oosanno taanii erida.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eeluntsi doorintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Taanii Kiristtoosar turo ohine, worddidhdhoos. Geeshi Ayyaana kaalitsize ta wozintta taanii worddidhoossanno taas markkidhane. <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>Ta wozintte Isra7eeluntsis gaama azzanon ashshoosse waaye ta gidda yene. <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Taanii, ta ishuntsin ta iginuntsi gisho Kiristtoosappa shaakkintti Xoozze baadditsappa oomora yezezako kadhane. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Unttin Isra7eeluntsana, Xoozii unttana fa na7untsana mahida, fa bonchchito unttis qonccizida. Unttara caaqqida; higge unttis inggida. Un Xooz goynode turii oge beezida; Xoozii ufays qaala unttis inggida. <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>Un yelinttera mayzunts kochchi; mahi Kiristtoosa ashora un kochchi maaqqii yi7ida. Ubbappa kattara maaqqide Xoozze medhinas anjjinttida. Amin77e!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:22">Keze 4:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Yezin, Xoozze qaaltta shaarinttida ga7e baaya. Isra7eeleppa yi7ide ubba turii Isra7eele maaqqoos. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>Mahi Abrahama kochchi ubba Abrahama na7a maaqqoos. Xoozii Abrahamas, «Ne zartta Yisaaqa baggara xeeginttoda» yagayda. <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Yinno gaazanna ashora yelinttide na7a ubbuntsi Xooz na7a maaqqoos. Yezin turii Isra7eele na7a Xoozii Abrahamas gelide qaaltti gaar yelinttide na7a.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Medho 21:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>yagaazanno.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Medho 21:12</ref></char></note> Xoozii inggoda ga7i gelide qaaltta, «Taanii wontsi bere hyannii wode yo7oda; Saaran dhiiratsi na7a yeloda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10">Medho 18:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Yinno xalaala baayzin Irbbiqa fettii nu aday Yisaaqappa mentte na7untsana wodaxide wode, <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>un yelinttodeppa iita woy lo77o oochchodeppa tiino oochara baayzin doorer maaqqize Xoozze qoftta minggode fana, <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>«Anggisse geezes kiitinttoda» yaga7i Laatstsii Irbbiqas ohida. <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Ga7intti xaafinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Medho 25:23</ref></char></note> Yinnan Geeshi Maxaafite, «Yayqooba kadhida, Eesawo ixxida»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2">Mil. 1:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Yeezin, nu waagawude? Xoozii firdda deshizane? Ade. <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Laatstsii Musego,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">«Ta maarodes koyduntsana maaroda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">ta yiqsinttodes koyduntsis yiqsinttoda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Keze 33:19</ref></char></note>yagayda. <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Yikke, Xoozze doore as qofa woy oochara baayzin E maarotitsite.<verse eid="ROM 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Geeshi Maxaafite, Gibxxe kaatizego, «Taanii, ta wolqqito neella beezodesin ta suntsita alame ubba gidda erinttode fana yinnis nena ka7itizida»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Keze 9:16</ref></char></note>ga7intti xaafinttida. <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Yikke, Xoozii maarodes koyzaya maarane; wozintto muumisades koyzay wozintto muumizane.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze kachiton maarotitsito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Yinttappa fetay, «Yeezin, Xooz asi iita oocha gisho akkos bore? Xoozze qoftto atto gawude oode?» Ga7i oocodes dandda7ane.<verse eid="ROM 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Yezin ta ishayo, Xoozara lallodes ne oode? Looqappa medhinttide miishe fana medhdhidego, «Tana hyannii gaar oochchii akkos medhdhido?»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:16">Isa. 29:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:9">45:9</ref></char></note> ga7i oocodes dandda7ane? <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Woy looqa medhdhiday fettii looqappa fetaya bonchcho miishe, hyankkaya mahi bore miishe mahi medhdhodes adetits wolqqa baaya?<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Xoozii fa kachchito beezodes fa wolqqito erssodes koyi, firddas giigide hyanqqo na7untsana gaama genccera dandda7ezako ne akko ere? <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Yinno E oochchidanna tiinii bonchchos giigizide, fa dooride na7untsis fa bonchchito qonccissades. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Ayhuduntsana xalaala maaqqikaayzin, Ayhude maaqqoosse nuunin Xoozara doorinttida.<verse eid="ROM 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Nabe Hose7e maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">«Ta asi maaqqikaayzuntsana, Ta asi ga7i xeegoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Ta siiqikaayze worzhito, ‹Siiqinttiduntsana› ga7i xeegoda.<verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>Un, ‹Ta worzha baaya› ga7intti xeeginttide besite,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hose. 2:23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">‹De7o Xoozze na7a› ga7intti xeeginttoda»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:10">Hose. 1:10</ref></char></note>yagayda.<verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Nabe Isayaasa Isra7eele asuntsbaz,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">«Isra7eele asuntsi abba gaxa yeze shafe fana gaanggikon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">unttappa eeratsi asuntsi xalaala attoda.<verse eid="ROM 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Yinna sa7alla afa ellisii folinttoda.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:22-23">Isa. 10:22-23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Mahi Isayaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">«Ubbappa wolqqaama Laatstse nuus eeratsi kochchi ashshikaayzako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">nuunii Soodoman gamoora katama fana dhabod yeshsha»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:29">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 1:9">Isa. 1:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>yaga7i tiinii ohida.<verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Yeezin, nu waagawude? Xillotitsi kaalloosse Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi ammanora xillotitsi denggida. <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Yezin xillotitsago yeltsize higge yeze Isra7eele asuntsi xillotitsi denggikaaya. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Akkos denggaanxido? Un xillotitsita ammanora baayzin oochara ekkodes koyde gishos. Yeyize gisho, un, «Dhubbize shuchchara» dhubbnttida. <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Geeshi Maxaafite, bo7ote</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">«Taanii Xiyoone dhubbize shuchchin lallan gaddoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">Eza ammanze oonin yeellidhoos»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 9:33">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa. 28:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>ga7intti xaafinttida.<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Ta ishuntso, ta kumutsi wozintte ta amudhizannan Xooz woosizanna Isra7eele attode fana. <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Un Xoozis mishinttane yezin, turii eratitsappa mishinttosanno ta markkidhane. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Un Xoozze xillotits ogito eranxii ixxii, fa omma xillotitsi kaallidap attin Xoozze xillotitsi koyikaaya. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Asi ubba ammanora xillode fana Kiristtoosa higge folida.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atotitsi ubbuntsis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Asi higge naagii ekkize xillotitsibaz Muse xaafittera, «Higge naagize oonin yinna higgito naagii de7o yezane»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Leewe 18:5</ref></char></note>yagayda. <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Yezin ammanora ekkize xillotitsbaz ga7inttidanna hyanno: «Ne wozintte, ‹Oonii salo kessade?› yaga7ippe; yinna Kiristtoosa wodhissades. <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Woy, ‹Sulle sa7a oomo wodhdhode oode?› ga7ippe; yinna Kiristtoosa boozappa kessodes.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:12-14">Mahe 30:12-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Yezin yaga7i xaafinttida: ‹Qaala ne kale; ne doontte ne wozintte yene› Nuunii yinttis ohize ammano qaaltta hyanno.<verse eid="ROM 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>«Yesuusa Laatstsii» ga7i ne doontte markkidhiko Xoozii eza hyayqoppa dentsidanno ne wozintte ammaniko, ne attoda. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Asi fa wozintte ammanii xillane; fa doontte markkidhii attane. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Geeshi maxaafite, «Eza ammanze oonin yeellidhoos»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa. 28:16</ref></char></note>yagayda. <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Fettii Xoozze ubbunts Laatstsii maaqqide gisho Ayhuduntsana maaqqin Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi gidda dummatitsi baaya. E fana xeegize ubbuntsis fa anjjito gaantsi inggane. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>«Laatstse suntsito xeegize oonin attoda.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:32">Iyu. 2:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Yeezin, un ammanosara wayzi eza xeegodes dandda7e? Un E baz si7ikaayzara wayzi eza ammanodes dandda7e? Mahi unttis qaala ohize asi baayzin, wayzi eza si7odes dandda7e? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Kiitinttide asi baayzin, qaala wayzi ohinttodes dandda7e? Geeshi Maxaafite, «Ufays Wonggele ohize asuntsi tohita wayzi lo77o yessa!» yaga7i xaafinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Isa. 52:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Yezin Isayaasa, «Laatstso, nu markkatitsito oode ammanido?» yaga7idanni fana, ubbuntsi Wonggele ammanikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa. 53:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Yinnii gisho, ammano sissappa ye7ine; si7izannan Kiristtoosa qaalappa ye7ine.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Maaqqo yezin, Isra7eele asuntsi qaala si7ikaaya ga7ene? Ade si7ida. Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">«Un ootsita sa7a ubba sinttida,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">un qaaltta sa7a gaxa yellida»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:4">Maz. 19:4</ref></char></note>yagayda. <verse eid="ROM 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Yezin Isra7eele asuntsi erikaaya ga7ene? Muse zaga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">«Taanii yinttana leqinttide asuntsara qiirissada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">mahi eeya asuntsara yinttana qiirissada»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Mahe 32:21</ref></char></note>yagayda.<verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Mahi Isayaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">«Tana koykaayze asuntsis benttida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">tana oocikaayze asuntsis qonccida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 10:20">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 65:1">Isa. 65:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>yaga7i zhashtikaayzara ohida.<verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Yezin Isra7eele baz ohittera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">«Ubba qamma kiitinttoosse asuntsisin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">tana ixxize asuntsis ta kushito miccida»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">Isa. 65:2</ref></char></note>yagayda.<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoozii Isra7eeluntsana olikaaya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Ane ta oocane: yeezin, Xoozii fa asuntsana olidaane? Olikaaya! Taanii ta ommite Isra7eele; Abrahama kochchi; Biniyame kochchi. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Xoozii tiino dooride fa asuntsana olikaaya. Geeshi Maxaafite, Eeliyaasa Isra7eeluntsana Xoozze tiino wayzi mootezako, yin eroso?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:5">Filph. 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>Eeliyaasa, «Laatstso, un ne nabuntsana wodhida, ne zharsho bestton lalida. Ta ta xalaalla attida; un tanan wodhodes koyane»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1 Kat. 19:10</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 19:14">14</ref></char></note>yagayda.<verse eid="ROM 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Xoozii ees waaga7i mahido? «Ba7aale eeqas goynikaayze laappun mukul asuntsana taas ashshida»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1 Kat. 19:18</ref></char></note>yagayda.<verse eid="ROM 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Yinnii gaaran, hyanna wodite Xoozii fa aadho keehatitsite dooriduntsappa attide (Isra7eeluntsi) yene. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>E unttana dooride fa aadho keehatitsitep attin un oochara baaya. Doore oochara maaqqiko, E aadho keehatitsita aadho keehatitsi maaqqoos.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Yeezin, waydo? Isra7eele fa koyzanno denggikaaya, yezin Xoozii dooriduntsii denggida. Attiduntsi fa wozintto muumizida. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>Yezin, Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">«Un fa aafte be7aame fana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">fa hyayte si7aame fana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">hyanno yellodes unttis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">Xoozii doccize ayyaana inggida»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:8">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 29:4">Mahe 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Isa. 29:10</ref></char>
    </note>ga7intti xaafinttide gaar hyanida. <verse eid="ROM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Mahi Dawute,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">«Un mu7ize gabita unttana xike fana aykko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">unttana gol7ize gaga maaqqo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">un iitatitsita unttana yello.<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Un be7aame fana un aaftta goozintto;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:22-23">Maz. 69:22-23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">ubba wode waayeppa denddi yin bantta kuunnii yezo» yagayda.<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Yeezin, Ayhuduntsi mahi denddaame fana gol7idaane? Baaya! Un gol7ita Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi attode fana mikinaate maaqqida. Yinnan Ayhuduntsi unttalla afa qana7ode fana oochchida. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Ayhudutsi nagartta alamttis gaama anjjo ki7ida; mahi un gol7ita Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsis gaama anjjo maaqqida. Yeezin, doorinttide Ayhuduntsi kumutsi attize wode anjjo akko fana ganggod yeshsha!<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Taanii, hyatte yinttis Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsis ohine. Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi hawaare maaqqii oochchizanne taanii gaama ceeqinttane. <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>Ta yinno oochchidanna taas asho kochchi maaqqize Isra7eeluntsana qiirizidanna unttappa eeratsito ashshodes. <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Xoozii unttana olii ashshide wode hyanna alamtta Xoozara giigida. Xoozii unttana shiishii ekkize wode hyayqide asi hyayqoppa denddize fana maaqqida.<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Tiino minxa aafize Xoozis zharshinttide geeshi maaqqiko, mulo minxa aafttan geeshi. Minxizes xaphita geeshi maaqqiko, zhanggitan geeshi. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Gade tukkide shamahe zhangge maaqqide Ayhuduntsi meqqiko, yin gurdde dolide shamahe zhangge maaqqize Ayhude maaqqoosuntsin un bessa dhantsinttii un aafe anjjiton duretitsito shaakkinttida. <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>Yikke, yin zhangge fana sarfinttii wodhdhide Ayhuduntsalla afa uturtippete. Yin uturtize baz maaqqiko, xapho yinttana tookkidap attin yin xapho tookkoosanno qoppote.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Neenii, «Yikke ta un besite gelode fana» ga7i qoppoda. <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Yinna turo. Un ammanikaayze gisho sarfinttida. Ne ammanide gisho yinna besite eqqida. Ne zhashtodes beezanep attin uturtodes beezoos. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Xoozii medho zhangge maaqqize Ayhuduntsis yiqsinttanxiko yinttisin yiqsinttoos.<verse eid="ROM 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Yikke, Xoozii akko gaar dalggan akko gaar zhashizako bo7o. E zhashizanna kiitinttosuntsalla, mahi E dalggatitsita yin ammanii miinggi eqqiko yinttis. Miinggi eqqanxiko yinttin sarfinttoda. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Ayhuduntsi ammaniko, zaga yeze besite maaqqada. Xoozii unttana mahi, geltsodes dandda7ane. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Yinttana gurdde yeze shamahe maaqqide Ayhude maaqqikaayzuntsana gachchii, gade tukkide shamahella afa yinttana dhantsiko, medho gade shamahe maaqqide Ayhuduntsana fa tiino bessa mahi tukkodes wayzi dandda7inttoosa? <figure style="fig" alt="Olive tree with its fruits" file="LB00087B.TIF" size="span" ref="11:24">Shamahe fa aafera</figure><verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozze maarotitsita ubbas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Ta ishuntso, yin yinttana eranchcha ga7i ceeqinttippete. Ta yinttis ohize fettii saza qofa yene. Yinnan Isra7eeluntsi si7anxi ixxidanna wurssutsi yellodes maaqqikaayzin attodes yeze Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi kumutsi Xoozago ye7ode wontsis. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Yinnii gaar, Isra7eele asuntsi ubbanna attoda. Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">«Nuna ashshizay Xiyooneppa yo7oda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">Yayqooba kochchappa iita ubba hyaasoda.<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Taanii un nagartto atto gaaze wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">unttara gelize caaqita hyanno» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:20-21">Isa. 59:20-21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:27">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 27:9">Isa. 27:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>ga7intti xaafinttida.<verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Ayhuduntsi Wonggele ekkanxide gisho yinttara morkke. Maaqqoyezin, hyatten un doornttide gishon, Xoozii un adunts gisho unttana kadhane. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Xoozii fa imoten fa xeegiten qiiridhdhoos. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Yin Ayhude maaqqoosuntsi zaga Xoozis kiitinttikaaya. Yezin hyatte Ayhuduntsi kiitinttanxi ixxin, yin Xoozze maarotitsito ekkida. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Yinnii gaar, yin ekkide maarotitsito Ayhuduntsi ekkode fana hyatte Xoozis kiitinttanxi ixxida. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Xoozii as ubbuntsis fa maarotitsito beezodes koyi, asi ubba kiitinttoosuntsana ga7i faydida.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Xoozze duretitsi, cinccatitsin eratitsi qoppii ohode oode? E firddita qurichinttoos, E ogita erinttoos. <verse eid="ROM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>Geeshi Maxaafite,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:8">Isa. 55:8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">«Laatstse qofa erize oode?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">eza zorodes dandda7ize oode?<verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>Xoozis tal77izen<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Isa. 40:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">tal7idanno mahi ekkize oode?»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 11:35">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 41:11">Iyo. 41:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>yagayda.<verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Ubbanna eeppa; eeran eesi. Ees medhinas bonchcho maaqqe. Amin77e.<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosar kille de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Yikke, ta ishuntso, Xoozza ufayssize, de7on geeshi zharsho mahi, yin galtto shiishode fana taanii yinttana Xoozze maarotitsite woossane. Yinnan Xoozza yin goynodes beezize turii oge. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Lo77o, ufayssizen folo maaqqide Xoozze qofa shaakkii erodes yin wozintte laaminttotep attin hyanna alamito aazippete.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Xoozii yin fetays fetays inggide ammanttii fana wozinaama asi fana qoppote. Qoppodes beezizannippa aatsii yinttana dummuzii, uturara qoppipete ga7i taas ingginttide aadho keehatitsite yinttis ohine. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Nu fettii gallitii gidda dumma dumma billituntsi yene; yinna dumma dumma billituntsis dumma dumma oocha yene. <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>Yinnii gaar, nuunii gaama asi maaqqikon Kiristtoosara fettii galla maaqqida. Nuunii fettii galla maaqqii dumma dumma billite fetay fetayra aykinttida. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Nuus ingginttide aadho keehatitsite dumma dumma imo yene. Nu imotta tinbbite ohe maaqqiko, nuus yeze ammanttii gaar ohodes beezane. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Nu imotta melluntsana maade maaqqiko, yinna oochite minggodes beezane; tamaarsse maaqqiko, yinna tamaarssite minggodes beezane. <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>Nu imotta melluntsana mintsitse maaqqiko, miinggi mintsitsodes beezane. Nu imotta nuus yeze bazappa melluntsis ingge maaqqiko, wozinappa inggodes beezane. Nu imotta ahe maaqqiko, miinggi ahodes beezane. Nu imotta melluntsis keehe maaqqiko, ufayssara keehodes beezane.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Yin siiqita afurappa kattara maaqqodes beezoos. Iita baz ixxote; lo77o baz mintsii aykkote. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Fetay fatayra ishe fana siiqinttote; fetay fetaya bonchchote. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Azal7ippete; yin ayyaanar miinggi Laatstsis oochchote. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Xoozii inggide ufayssara ufayttote; madha dandda7ote; ubba wode Xooz woossote. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Ammanze geeshshuntsana koshshize bazara maaddote; zaqqo mokkote.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Yinttana bay7izuntsana anjjote; anjjotep attin baaddippete. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Ufayttizuntsara ufayttote; yeekkizuntsara yeekkote. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Fetay fetayra fettii qofite yezote. Utura qofa ashshii, yinttana ziqii yiizii, aada asuntsara wolla yezote. Yin yinttana era ga7i qoppipete.<verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Ooden yinttis iita baz oochchiko, ye atstses iita mahippete. As ubba tiino nashshize lo77o oocha oochchote. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Dandda7inttiko as ubbara saro yessades yinttis dandda7inttizanno ubba oochchote. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Ta ishuntso, yin, yin ommite asis qime mahippete. Xoozii qime mahode fana ees ashshote. Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:19">«Taanii qime mahoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:19">taanii kushito mahoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 12:19">yagaane Laatstsii, ga7intti xaafinttida.<verse eid="ROM 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Yezin Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">«Ne morkkizaya naydhdhiko muzo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">E baridhdhiko ushsho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 12:20">Ne yinno oochchiko E ommite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 12:20">tama qaaqa gussane»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 12:20">ga7intti xaafinttida.<verse eid="ROM 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Iita lo77or gamotep attin iitara gaminttippe.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Worzha ahizuntsis kiitintte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Xoozze qofa baayzin adetits wolqqa ingginttoose gishon hyatte yeze shuumuntsin Xoozze qofara shuumunttide gisho asi ubba worzha ahizuntsis kiitnttodes beezane. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Yinnii gisho, adetits wolqqara yezuntsis kiitinttanxi ixxize oonin Xoozze kiita ixxane. Kiitinttanxi ixxize oonin faalla afa firdda ke7ine. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Ahizuntsii iita oochchizuntsana fattin lo77o oochchizuntsana zhashoos. Ahizuntsis zhashitaanxodes koyane? Yeezako lo77o oochcho; un nena galatoda. <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>Un lo77o baz oochchodes shuumunttide Xoozze aro. Yezin ne iita baz oochchiko, un iita baz oochchiza seerize mashsha aykkide gisho unttis zhashito. Un iita oochchizuntsana seerii, Xoozze hyanqqo qonccize Xoozze aro. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozze kachchi xalaalas baayzin yin qoftta markkidhize gisho worzha ahizuntsis kiitinttodes beezane.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Yin giira giirizannan yinnis. Worzha ahizuntsii yinna oochito oochchizanna, un Xoozze aro maaqqide gishos. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Fetes fetes beezanno inggote. Giira giirodes beezays giirote; qaraxe gachchodes beezays qaraxe gachchote; zhashtodes beezays zhashtote; bonchcho beezaya bonchchote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:21">Maato. 22:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:17">Mar. 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:25">Luqa. 20:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Siiqinttote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Fetay fetera siiqinttote. Siiqo galep attin yinttalla afa melle gale yezippe. Asi siiqize oonin higge gaazanno folida. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>«Laammippe; wodhippe; kaystippe; amudhdhippe» gaaze kiittan melluntsin ubba, «Asi ne ommiti fana kadho» gaaze kiitte accinttida. <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Asi siiqize oonin ezalla afa iita baz oochchoos. Yinnii gisho, asi siiqize higge kiita folida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-17">Keze 20:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-19">Mahe 5:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Leewe 19:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Genttoppa yin barkkize wode hyatte yellidanno erote. Nu ammanide woditippa aadhii atotitsi hyatte nuugo ukkida. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Qamma aadhida; wontta ukkida. Yikke, nuunii dhuma oocha ashshii foo7o ola miishe aykkoda. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Ane awara foo7o yeze asi fana wogara yezote. Beezoosse yetstsaran matstsera maaqqippe olale hyantteran qayxer aykkinttide dumma dumma tuna oocha,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Olale hyanttera yellii dumma dumma tuna oocha: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Woy yetstsara, matstsera, olale hyanttera, qayxera maaqqippe ga7i billodes dandda7inttane. Olale hyanttara yellize dumma dumma tuna oochita asi Xoozze aheppa bale kezii xootsi woga kaallii folize oocha ga7e.</char></note> Lalleran qinaatera maaqqippe. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa ma77ote; yin nagara asho fa amuto folode fana qoppipete.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Asalla afa firddippete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Ammanora labbide oonan shiishii ekkotep attin E qoftilla afa firddippete. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Aazizes, ammanora miinggide fettii asi akko katstsan ma7ades dandda7ane. Yezin ammanora labbide asi atakiltte xalaala muune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:16">Qola. 2:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Muuze asi mo7oosse atstsa borippe. Mo7oosse atstse muuze atstsella afa firddippe. Xoozii ubbuntsana ekkane. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Melle as arolla firddize ne oode? E labbin woy miinggin E Laatstse erane. Laatstsii eza essodes dandda7ize gisho E miinggi eqqoda.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Mahi «Fettii awara melle awarappa aadhane» yaga7i qoppize asi yene. Melle mahi, «Awara ubba fettii fana» ga7i qoppane. Yezin fete fete fa qoftto qoppii oochcho. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Fettii qammiza melle qammitipa aatsii bonchchize oonin Laatstse bonchchos ga7i oochchane. Katstsa muuze asi Laatstse bonchchos ga7i muune. E muuze yinna katsitii gisho Xooz galatane. Katstsa mo7oosse asi Laatstse bonchchos me7anxi ashshane; mahi me7anxi ashsheran Xooz galatane. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Nuuppa oonin faas yezoos; mahi nu giddappa oonin faas hyayqoos. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Nu de7or yeziko Laatstsis yessada; mahi hyayqqikon Laatstsis hyayqqoda. Yikke, nu de7or yezin woy hyayqqikon Laatstsis.<verse eid="ROM 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Kiristtoosa hyayqqii hyayqqoppa denddide, de7or yezuntsisin hyayqqiduntsis Laatstse maaqqades. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Yeezin, ne ne ishella afa akkos firdde? Woy ne ne isha akkos leqqe? Nuunii ubbanna Xoozze firdda oyda tiino eqqoda.<verse eid="ROM 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Geeshi Maxaafite Laatstsii,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:10">2 Qoro. 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:23">Isa. 45:23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">«Taanii de7o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">asi ubba ta tiino bunqqinttoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">taanii Xooz maaqqizanno markkidhoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 14:11">yagayda. <verse eid="ROM 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Yikke, nu oochchide bazitis nu ommite ommite Xooz tiino shiiqii mahe inggoda.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Melle asi dhubutsippete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Yinnii gisho, nuunii fetay fetaylla afa firddizanno ashshote. Yezin yin ishaya dhubutsaame fana woy qaxxaame fana naaginttote. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Laatstse Yesuusa ammanze asi maaqqii, fa ommite tuna maaqqide baz baayzanno taanii geeshi erane. Yezin fettii asi fettii baz tuna mahi qoppiko yinna ees tuna maaqqane. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Ne muuze katstsa gisho ne ishaya dhubbize baz maaqqiko, Kiristtoosa yeze ne ishaya siiqoos. Kiristtoosa E gisho hyayqqide atstsa ne muuze katstsiti gisho dhabsippe. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Yikke, yinttis yeze lo77o bazito cazhizippete. <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Xoozze ka7itumo Geeshi Ayyaanara benttize xillotetsi, sarotitsin turii ufayssap attin muuze bazin uzhize bazi baaya. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Yinnii gaar Kiristtoosas oochchize asi Xooz ufayssane; as giddan anjjinttane.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Yinnii gisho, ane nuunii sarotitsi benttize ogen fete fetaya ammanora mintsize oge koyote. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Katstsa gisho ga7i Xoozze oochito lalippe. Katstsa ubba geeshi, yezin melle asi nagarara dhubbize katstsa mu7izanna iita. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Ne ishay dhubunttaame fana asho mo7oosanna woy ushi uzhoosanna woy ne ishay dhubbize akko bazin oochchoosanna lo77o.<verse eid="ROM 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Yikke, ne ammantto ne giddan ne Xoozze gidda naago. Likke ga7i qoppidebaz oochchize wode E wozintta mootoosse atstse anjjinttidaya. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Yezin so7itter muuze atstses E muuze ammanora maaqqikaayze gisho firddinttane. Ammano baayzin oochinttide oocha ubba nagara.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Melluntsana ufayssodes beezane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Nuunii minggiduntsi labbiduntsi toofito tookkodes beezane. Nuunii nuna ufayssodes beezoos. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Nuunii nu dootsiza mintsitsodes maaddodesin ufayssodes beezane. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Kiristtoosa fana ufayssikaaya. Yezin Geeshi Maxaafite, «Nena boride borita nuna yellida»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Maz. 69:9</ref></char></note>ga7intti xaafinttidanni gaar hyanida. <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Geeshi Maxaafite inggize genccon mintsitsera nu ufayssito ekkode fana Geeshi Maxaafite xaafinttide ubbanna nuna tamaarssodes xaafinttida.<verse eid="ROM 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Genccon mintsitimo inggize Laatstse yin Kiristtoos Yesuusa kaallize wode fettetitsi yinttis imme. <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>Yinnan, nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa Adaya, Xoozza, fettetitsaran fettii qaalara yin bonchchode fana.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wonggele asi ubbas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Kiristtoosa yinttana ekkidanni fana Xoozze bonchchos fetay fetaya ekkote. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Xoozii zaga aduntsis inggide ufayssita folinttode fanan E turetitsita erinttode fana Kiristtoosa Ayhudunts garraze woga folera aro maaqqii yi7idanno ta yinttis ohine. <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>Kiristtoosa Ayhudunts garraze woga aro maaqqide melle mikinaata mahi Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi Xoozze maarotitsiti gisho galatode fana. Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">«Ta nena Ayhude maaqqoosse asunts gidda galatoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">Ne suntsito mazmurer sabboda» <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 22:50">2 Sam. 22:50</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 18:49">Maz. 18:49</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:9">ga7intti xaafinttide gaar hyanida.<verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Mahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">«Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:10">Xoozze asuntsara ufayttote»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:10">yagayda.<verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>Hyatten mahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">«Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">Laatstsa galatote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">worzha ubba eza sabbote»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:11">yagayda.<verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>Yinnii gaar Isayaasa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">«Issey kochchappa yelinttode fetay ye7oda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">E ka7itumo ubba ahoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Un fa ufayssito eella afa gaddoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:12">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:10">Isa. 11:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>yagayda.<verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Geeshi Ayyaana wolqqara yin diccode fana ufayssi inggide Xoozze, yin ammanttii baggara yinttis ufayssin sarotits kumutsi imme.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa xaafide mikinaate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Ta ishuntso, yinttara lo77otitsin eratitsi kumiduntsana mahi fetay fetaya zorodes dandda7izanno ta loytsii erane. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Taanii yinttana fettii fettibaz qofissades koyi zhashtikaayzara Xoozze aadho keehatitsara yinttis xaafida. <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>Taanii Kiristtoos Yesuusa aro maaqqii, Ayhude maaqqoosuntsis kahine fana maaqqii, Wonggele ohode fana Xoozii taas aadho keehatitsi inggida. Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi Geeshi Ayyaanara geezhi, Xooz ufayssize zharsho maaqqode fana Xoozii yinno oochchida.<verse eid="ROM 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Taanii Kiristtoos Yesuusar maaqqii ta Xoozzes oochchize oochite ceeqinttane. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi Xoozis kiitinttode fana, Kiristtoosa ta qaaltten ta oochchiti baggara oochchide oochchitippa melle ta ceeqinttize baz baaya. <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>Xoozii yinno kille baz oocharan Geeshi Ayyaana wolqqara wayzi oochchezako ta yinttis ohoda. Taanii Yerusalaameppa dentsii, Iliwarqoone yellodes Kiristtoosa Wonggele sabbakida. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Taanii melle asi baaside baasalla keexxodes koyoos. Kiristtoosa suntsita xeeginttikaayze bessa Wonggele ohodes amudhdhane. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Geeshi Maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">«E bazi ohinttikaayze asuntsi eza be7ada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">E baz si7ikaayze asuntsi qoppoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 15:21">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 52:15">Isa. 52:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>ga7intti xaafinttida.<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Roome qitodes qoppida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Yinnii mikinaatera, taanii yinttago yo7odes dandda7ikaaya. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Yezin taanii hyatte hyanna gututo ubba ta yellii hyaaside gishon gaama bereppa dentsii yinttana be7odes amudhdhide gisho<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:13">Rome 1:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>taanii Isppeene hyanggitera yinttana be7odes qoppida. Mahi eeratsi wode yinttara ufayttideppa suuba Isppeene hyanggize wode yin oges tana maaddode fana koyane.<verse eid="ROM 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Yezin hyatte taanii Xoozze asuntsana maaddodes Yerusalaame hyanggoda. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Maqedooniyan Akkaya gidda yeze Xoozze asuntsi, Yerusalaame yeze dahuntsana miishera maaddodes koyde gisho. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Un dahuntsana maaddizanna unttis attoossebaz maaqqide gisho fa ommite yinno oochchodes qofa accida. Ayhuduntsara Ayhude maaqqikaayzuntsin ayyaana anjjo shaginttiko, un mahi unttis yeze bazara Ayhuduntsana maaddodes beezane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">1 Qoro. 16:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Yinnii gisho, taanii yinna shiiqide miishito unttis inggi un ekkidanno erideppa suuba Isppeene hyanggitera yin kalera aadhoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:11">1 Qoro. 9:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Taanii yinttago hyanggize wode Kiristtoosa anjjo kumutsi ekkii hyanggodanno erane.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Ta ishuntso, taas Xooz woossittera ta butuntte taara eqqode fana Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosaran Geeshi Ayyaana siiqite yinttana woossane. <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>Xoozii tana Yihuda yeze ammanoose asuntsappa ashshode fana Yerusalaame ta oochchode oochita Xooz asunts kale ekkinttode fana taas woossote. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Mahi Xoozii gayko, taanii yinttago hyanggi ufayssara yinttara shemppode fana taas woossote. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Sarotits Xoozze yin ubbuntsara maaqqe. Amin77e.<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Saritse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Kinkkiriya katama yeze woosa keetstsite oochchize nu mishita Feeba lo77o maacho maaqqidanno yin erode fana koyane. <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>Yin izo ammanze asuntsi Laatstse suntsite mokkodes beezize ammanze asuntsappa fete fana mokkite. Iza yinttappa koyze baz ubba izo maaddote. Iza fa ommite gaama asi maaddida; mahi tana ta ommite gaama maaddida.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Kiristtoos Yesuusa oocha taara wolla oochchize Phirisqilan Aqiila saro ga7ote. <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>Un ta gisho fa shemppito aatsii inggida. Ta xalaalas baayzin Ayhude maaqqoosse asunts woosa keetsuntsin ubba unttana galatane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:2">Hawa. 18:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Un kara shiiqize ammanzunts saro ga7ote.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Isiya sa7a Kiristtoosa tiino ammanide, ta kadhize Ephanexoosas ta saritsito yeltsote.<verse eid="ROM 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Yinnii gisho oochara gaama labbide Mayramo saro ga7ote. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Taara achi keetstsa yezide ta Ayhude lagguntsana Anddironiqoosan Yuuniyasa saro ga7ote. Un Yesuusa hawaaruntsi gidda erinttiduntsana. Mahi un Kiristtoosa taappa tiino ammanida.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Laatstse ammanze ta siiqo laggiza, Amphiliyaxoosa saro ga7ote. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Kiristtoosa oocha nuura wolla oochchize Urbbanoosan ta kadhize Isttakuusa saro ga7ote. <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Kiristtoosas yezanna fattanintti ammantsize Apheliisa saro ga7ote. Arsxobuloosa kara asuntsana saro ga7ote. <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Ta Ayhude laggiza Heroodiyoona saro ga7ote.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:11">Narssisanen E kara asuntsappa Kiristtoosa ammaniduntsana saro ga7ote.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Laatstse oocha labbize Tirufaynan Tirufoosa saro ga7ote. Mahi Laatstsis gaama labbii oochchize, ta kadhize Phersiiso saro ga7ote. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Laatstse oochara gaama erinttide Rufoosasin tana fa na7a fana be7ize E intto saro ga7ote. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Asinikirttoosas, Filegoonas, Hermmeesas, Patirobaasasin unttara yeze ammanze ishuntsi ubbuntsis ta saritsito ohote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 15:21">Mar. 15:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Filoloogusa, Yuuliya, Neeriya, E mishito, Olumppoosan unttara yeze ammanze asuntsana ubba saro ga7ote.<verse eid="ROM 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Geeshi yeerintte yeerinttitera, fetay fetaya saritsote. Kiristtoosa woosa keetstsi ubba yinttana saro gaane.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssutsi zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>Ta ishuntso, yin tamaaride timirttito ixxii, yin gidda shaakkintten madha medhdhize asuntsappa naaginttote. Unttappa hyaakkote. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Yinnii fana yeze asuntsi fa sazasip attin nu Laatstse Kiristtoosas oochchoos. Fa mal77ize doonaran yiqsize qaalara akko eroosse asunts wozintto balitsane. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Wonggeles yin kiitinttidanno asi ubba si7ide gisho tana ufayssane. Yezin yin lo77o baz erode fana iita bazappa hyaakkode fana ta koyane. <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Sarotits Xoozze Xalahe yin tohitippa oomora gaacii oloda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatitsita yinttara maaqqe.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Taara oochchize Ximotiyoosa yinttana lo77o yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Hawa. 16:1</ref></char></note> Yinnii gaaran, ta iginuntsi Luqiyosa, Iyaasonen Sosphaxiroosa yinttana saro gaane.<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Hyay dabddaabbiza Phawuloosas xaafide taanii, Xarxiyoosa, yinttana Laatstse suntsite saro gaane.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Tana mokkize woosa keetsito ubba E kara shiiqize Gaayoosa, yinttana saro gayda. Katama miishe aykkize Erasxoosan nu ishe Qarxoosa yinttana saro gaane. [<verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>Nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatitsi yin ubbara maaqqe. Amin77e.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zaga tiino maxaafite faydo 24 baaya.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Xoozis galata maaqqe. Taanii, Yesuus Kiristtoosa baz ohize Wonggele qaaltte gaama wodeppa aachintti gam7ide turetitsara, Xoozii yinttana ammanora mintsii essodes dandda7ane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Hawa. 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 1:14">1 Qoro. 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:20">2 Ximo. 4:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Yezin hyatte yinna turita qonccida. Ka7itumo ubba ammanii kiitinttode fana medhina Xoozze kiitte nabuntsi yinna turttibaz xaafida.<verse eid="ROM 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara cinccatitsi E xalaalas yeze, fettii Xoozzes medhinas bonchcho maaqqe. Amin77e.<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
